***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** LOCAL WORKERMILL CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values:
***REMOVED***   cp .env.local.example .env.local
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** Then start local WorkerMill:
***REMOVED***   ./bin/local-workermill start --epic
***REMOVED*** =============================================================================

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** DATABASE
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://workermill:localdev@localhost:5432/workermill

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** EXECUTION MODE
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Set to "local" for local development (spawns local processes instead of ECS)
EXECUTION_MODE=local

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** CLAUDE MAX AUTHENTICATION (Required for local mode)
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Get this by running: claude auth login
***REMOVED*** Then copy the token from: cat ~/.claude/credentials.json
***REMOVED*** Or run: claude setup-token
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** LOCAL WORKER SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Maximum concurrent Epic Coordinators (local processes)
MAX_LOCAL_WORKERS=4

***REMOVED*** Maximum parallel experts per task (each gets a git worktree)
MAX_PARALLEL_EXPERTS=4

***REMOVED*** Base path for git worktrees (relative to project root or absolute)
WORKTREE_BASE_PATH=../workermill-workers

***REMOVED*** Number of pre-created worktrees in the pool
WORKTREE_POOL_SIZE=8

***REMOVED*** Target repository for workers to operate on
***REMOVED*** This is the repo that AI workers will make changes to
TARGET_REPO_PATH=../oncallshift-api

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** API SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=debug

***REMOVED*** JWT secret for local auth (use any random string)
JWT_SECRET=local-dev-secret-change-in-production

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** EPIC MODE SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Enable planning agent critic review (validates plans before execution)
ENABLE_CRITIC_REVIEW=true

***REMOVED*** Max iterations for critic to request plan revisions
MAX_CRITIC_ITERATIONS=3

***REMOVED*** Score threshold for auto-approval (0-100)
AUTO_APPROVAL_THRESHOLD=85

***REMOVED*** Enable tech lead review of completed work
ENABLE_TECH_LEAD_REVIEW=true

***REMOVED*** Max revision iterations for tech lead review
MAX_REVIEW_REVISIONS=3

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** MEMORY SYSTEM (Optional)
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Enable memory system for enhanced context
ENABLE_MEMORY_SYSTEM=false

***REMOVED*** Enable codebase indexing (requires additional setup)
CODEBASE_INDEXING_ENABLED=false

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SCM TOKENS (Optional - for PR creation)
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Get these from your source control provider settings
***REMOVED*** Only needed if you want workers to create PRs

***REMOVED*** GitHub personal access token
***REMOVED*** GITHUB_TOKEN=

***REMOVED*** Bitbucket repository access token
***REMOVED*** BITBUCKET_TOKEN=

***REMOVED*** GitLab personal access token
***REMOVED*** GITLAB_TOKEN=

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** JIRA INTEGRATION (Optional - for ticket updates)
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** JIRA_BASE_URL=https://your-org.atlassian.net
***REMOVED*** JIRA_EMAIL=your-email@example.com
***REMOVED*** JIRA_API_TOKEN=

***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** COGNITO (Optional - only if using auth locally)
***REMOVED*** -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** For local development, you can skip Cognito and use direct auth
***REMOVED*** COGNITO_USER_POOL_ID=
***REMOVED*** COGNITO_CLIENT_ID=
